   "steps_unavailable": "Invariable adverb placed BEFORE the expression of change it modifies (だんだん + verb/adjective, e.g. だんだん暖かくなる). The record states it does not inflect and applies no operation to its host; the closed op enum only transforms a base and appends material after it, so no step list can place だんだん in front. The combinations the record lists (〜なる, 〜てくる, 〜ていく) are the host predicate's own morphology, not steps this point performs."
  },
