   "steps_unavailable": "Invariable adverb placed BEFORE the verb (どんどん + verb, e.g. どんどん増える, どんどん食べてください). The record describes position and collocation, not morphology: nothing is inflected and nothing is suffixed to any base, and the op enum has no prepend operation. Encoding the 〜てください half would emit generic polite-request morphology carrying none of this point's own material."
