   "steps_unavailable": "Two different things share one record and neither yields a safe step list. (a) The primary use the record gives is a sentence-initial conjunction opening an independent second sentence (高いです。ですが、買います); it takes no base, inflects nothing, and the op enum has no prepend operation. (b) The clause-final use is stated only as 'です/だ + が' with no part-of-speech condition, and taken literally that licenses the ungrammatical *行くだが and *高いだが — だ attaches to nouns and na-adjectives only, while verbs and i-adjectives take が directly (行くが / 高いが) or the polite ますが/ですが. The record does not carry that split, so emitting steps would invent it."
  },
