   "steps_unavailable": "Lexical verb pairs, not a derivation. The record states outright that there is no single rule ('Não há uma regra única') and lists pairs of independent dictionary words (開ける/開く, 閉める/閉まる, 始める/始まる, 入れる/入る, 出す/出る, 消す/消える, 落とす/落ちる) whose shapes differ pair by pair, so no op sequence maps one member onto the other. What the record does state generally is a particle rule (transitive takes を, intransitive takes が), which constrains the clause around the verb rather than building a form from a base."
  },
